"We have that\n\n$$(\\mathbf{u} + \\mathbf{v}) \\cdot (2 \\mathbf{u} - \\mathbf{v}) = 2 \\mathbf{u} \\cdot \\mathbf{u} - \\mathbf{u} \\cdot \\mathbf{v} + \\mathbf{v} \\cdot \\mathbf{u} - \\mathbf{v} \\cdot \\mathbf{v} = 2 \\cdot 2^2 - (-1) + (-1) - 2^2 = 8 + 1 - 1 - 4 = 4.$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\\cos \\theta = \\frac{(\\mathbf{u} + \\mathbf{v}) \\cdot (2 \\mathbf{u} - \\mathbf{v})}{\\|\\mathbf{u} + \\mathbf{v}\\| \\|2 \\mathbf{u} - \\mathbf{v}\\|} = \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{5} \\cdot \\sqrt{5}} = \\frac{4}{5} = \\boxed{\\frac{4}{5}}.$$"
